<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini hendaklah terpakai bagi Semenanjung Malaysia dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@/~cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@> .
