<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@/~cl_2__subsec_9> <https://schema.org/text> "Bagi maksud seksyen ini—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/12/msa@> .
